 "Begin Your Degree at PCU": "Mulai Gelar Anda di PCU",
 "Join our diverse community of international students and earn your degree from one of Indonesia's premier universities.": "Bergabunglah dengan komunitas mahasiswa internasional kami yang beragam dan raih gelar Anda dari salah satu universitas terkemuka di Indonesia.",
 "Transform communities while transforming yourself through meaningful service learning in rural Indonesia.": "Mentransformasi komunitas sekaligus mentransformasi diri Anda melalui service learning yang bermakna di pedesaan Indonesia.",
 "Program Overview": "Gambaran Program",
 "The International Community Outreach Program (COP) is an integrated service-learning program that combines academic study with meaningful community engagement. Students partner with local communities across rural Java to address real social challenges while developing cross-cultural competence, leadership skills, and global citizenship.": "International Community Outreach Program (COP) adalah program service-learning terpadu yang memadukan studi akademik dengan keterlibatan masyarakat yang bermakna. Mahasiswa bermitra dengan komunitas lokal di pedesaan Jawa untuk mengatasi tantangan sosial nyata sambil mengembangkan kompetensi lintas budaya, keterampilan kepemimpinan, dan kewarganegaraan global.",
 "2-8 weeks intensive immersion": "Pendalaman intensif 2-8 minggu",
 "Location": "Lokasi",
 "Rural villages across East Java": "Desa-desa di Jawa Timur",
 "Community Focus": "Fokus Komunitas",
 "Education, health, environment, livelihoods": "Pendidikan, kesehatan, lingkungan, mata pencaharian",
 "Four Pillars of COP": "Empat Pilar COP",
 "Academic Learning": "Pembelajaran Akademik",
 "Interdisciplinary classroom study exploring development issues, cultural studies, and social entrepreneurship before field placement.": "Studi kelas lintas disiplin yang menjelajahi isu pembangunan, kajian budaya, dan kewirausahaan sosial sebelum penempatan lapangan.",
 "Service & Social Action": "Pengabdian & Aksi Sosial",
 "Direct engagement with community partners on high-impact projects addressing local needs—education, health, environmental sustainability.": "Keterlibatan langsung dengan mitra komunitas pada proyek berdampak tinggi yang menjawab kebutuhan lokal—pendidikan, kesehatan, kelestarian lingkungan.",
 "Cultural Immersion": "Pendalaman Budaya",
 "Live alongside Indonesian host families, learn the language, and deepen understanding of local values, traditions, and worldviews.": "Tinggal bersama keluarga angkat Indonesia, belajar bahasa, dan memperdalam pemahaman tentang nilai, tradisi, dan pandangan hidup lokal.",
 "Reflection & Growth": "Refleksi & Pertumbuhan",
 "Regular guided reflection on personal transformation, ethical leadership, and commitment to global social responsibility.": "Refleksi terbimbing secara berkala tentang transformasi pribadi, kepemimpinan etis, dan komitmen terhadap tanggung jawab sosial global.",
 "Focus Areas of Community Engagement": "Bidang Fokus Keterlibatan Masyarakat",
 "Education & Youth Development": "Pendidikan & Pengembangan Pemuda",
 "English language support, STEM mentoring, scholarship assistance, and skills training for underserved youth.": "Dukungan bahasa Inggris, pendampingan STEM, bantuan beasiswa, dan pelatihan keterampilan bagi pemuda yang kurang terlayani.",
 "Environmental Sustainability": "Kelestarian Lingkungan",
 "Community-led conservation initiatives, waste management education, sustainable agriculture practices, and climate adaptation projects.": "Inisiatif konservasi berbasis masyarakat, edukasi pengelolaan sampah, praktik pertanian berkelanjutan, dan proyek adaptasi iklim.",
 "Health & Wellness": "Kesehatan & Kebugaran",
 "Health awareness campaigns, maternal and child health initiatives, nutrition education, and community health worker training.": "Kampanye kesadaran kesehatan, inisiatif kesehatan ibu dan anak, edukasi gizi, dan pelatihan kader kesehatan masyarakat.",
 "Economic Empowerment & Livelihoods": "Pemberdayaan Ekonomi & Mata Pencaharian",
 "Microenterprise development, vocational training, women's economic cooperatives, and sustainable income generation initiatives.": "Pengembangan usaha mikro, pelatihan vokasi, koperasi ekonomi perempuan, dan inisiatif penciptaan pendapatan berkelanjutan.",
 "Social Justice & Rights": "Keadilan Sosial & Hak",
 "Advocacy for vulnerable populations, gender equality initiatives, and community empowerment for marginalized groups.": "Advokasi bagi kelompok rentan, inisiatif kesetaraan gender, dan pemberdayaan masyarakat bagi kelompok terpinggirkan.",
 "Typical Program Flow": "Alur Program Umum",
 "Pre-Departure Preparation (1-2 weeks)": "Persiapan Pra-Keberangkatan (1-2 minggu)",
 "Orientation on cultural sensitivity, Indonesian language basics, program objectives, and expectations. Team building and partner briefing.": "Orientasi tentang kepekaan budaya, dasar bahasa Indonesia, tujuan program, dan ekspektasi. Pembentukan tim dan pengarahan mitra.",
 "Community Integration (Days 1-3)": "Integrasi Komunitas (Hari 1-3)",
 "Arrival in host village, meet host family, community welcomes and orientation. Begin casual language practice and cultural learning.": "Kedatangan di desa tujuan, bertemu keluarga angkat, penyambutan komunitas dan orientasi. Mulai latihan bahasa santai dan pembelajaran budaya.",
 "Active Service & Learning (Days 4-End)": "Pengabdian & Pembelajaran Aktif (Hari 4-Selesai)",
 "Daily project work with community partners. Regular classroom sessions with facilitated reflection. Evening cultural exchanges and language practice.": "Kerja proyek harian dengan mitra komunitas. Sesi kelas rutin dengan refleksi terfasilitasi. Pertukaran budaya dan latihan bahasa di malam hari.",
 "Closing & Reflection": "Penutupan & Refleksi",
 "Community celebration honoring partnership and friendships. Final reflection on personal transformation and commitments to continued impact.": "Perayaan komunitas yang menghormati kemitraan dan persahabatan. Refleksi akhir tentang transformasi pribadi dan komitmen untuk dampak berkelanjutan.",
