 "Student Experiences": "Pengalaman Mahasiswa",
 "\"My semester at PCU was transformative. The faculty was supportive, and I made lifelong friends from around the world. Indonesian hospitality is real!\"": "\"Semester saya di PCU sangat mengubah hidup. Para dosen sangat mendukung, dan saya mendapatkan sahabat seumur hidup dari seluruh dunia. Keramahan Indonesia itu nyata!\"",
 "\"The International Office was incredibly helpful with everything from visa issues to finding accommodation. I felt welcomed from day one.\"": "\"Kantor Internasional sangat membantu dalam segala hal, mulai dari urusan visa hingga mencari akomodasi. Saya merasa diterima sejak hari pertama.\"",
 "Ready to Start Your Journey?": "Siap Memulai Perjalanan Anda?",
 "Join hundreds of students from around the world who have experienced transformative semesters at Petra Christian University.": "Bergabunglah dengan ratusan mahasiswa dari seluruh dunia yang telah merasakan semester yang mengubah hidup di Universitas Kristen Petra.",
