 "Language & Culture": "Bahasa & Budaya",
 "Kaohsiung, Taiwan": "Kaohsiung, Taiwan",
 "Master of Management": "Magister Manajemen",
 "Advanced business management program covering strategic planning, organizational behavior, and international business operations in the Asia-Pacific region.": "Program manajemen bisnis lanjutan yang mencakup perencanaan strategis, perilaku organisasi, dan operasi bisnis internasional di kawasan Asia-Pasifik.",
 "Graduate Program": "Program Pascasarjana",
