 "IT & Software": "TI & Perangkat Lunak",
 "Typical Joint Degree Structure": "Struktur Gelar Bersama yang Umum",
 "Year 1-2: Foundation at PCU": "Tahun 1-2: Dasar di PCU",
 "Complete core curriculum and foundational courses at PCU in Surabaya. Develop language skills and cultural understanding.": "Selesaikan kurikulum inti dan mata kuliah dasar di PCU Surabaya. Kembangkan keterampilan bahasa dan pemahaman budaya.",
 "Year 3-4: Specialization at Partner University": "Tahun 3-4: Spesialisasi di Universitas Mitra",
 "Complete specialized courses at Dongseo University or Nanjing University. Apply foundational knowledge in new context.": "Selesaikan mata kuliah spesialisasi di Dongseo University atau Nanjing University. Terapkan pengetahuan dasar dalam konteks baru.",
 "Graduation with Joint Degree": "Wisuda dengan Gelar Bersama",
 "Receive single degree officially awarded by both PCU and partner university. Recognized globally.": "Terima satu gelar yang diberikan secara resmi oleh PCU dan universitas mitra. Diakui secara global.",
 "Ready to Pursue a Joint Degree?": "Siap Menempuh Gelar Bersama?",
 "Combine the best of two worlds and earn an internationally recognized degree from PCU and our esteemed partners.": "Padukan yang terbaik dari dua dunia dan raih gelar yang diakui secara internasional dari PCU dan mitra terhormat kami.",
 "What is a Double Degree?": "Apa itu Gelar Ganda?",
 "A Double Degree program allows students to earn two separate but related degrees from two institutions. Students complete full degree requirements at both PCU and an international partner university, receiving two distinct diplomas recognized by each institution.": "Program Gelar Ganda memungkinkan mahasiswa meraih dua gelar terpisah namun terkait dari dua institusi. Mahasiswa menyelesaikan seluruh persyaratan gelar di PCU dan universitas mitra internasional, serta menerima dua ijazah berbeda yang diakui oleh masing-masing institusi.",
 "• Two separate degrees awarded": "• Dua gelar terpisah diberikan",
 "• Independent curriculums": "• Kurikulum yang independen",
 "• Extended study period": "• Periode studi yang lebih panjang",
 "• Study time at both institutions": "• Waktu studi di kedua institusi",
 "• Two graduation ceremonies": "• Dua upacara wisuda",
 "• Two internationally recognized credentials": "• Dua kredensial yang diakui secara internasional",
 "• Deep expertise in two institutions": "• Keahlian mendalam di dua institusi",
 "• Enhanced career opportunities": "• Peluang karier yang lebih besar",
 "• Global professional network": "• Jaringan profesional global",
 "• Maximum academic flexibility": "• Fleksibilitas akademik maksimal",
 "Double Degree Programs Available": "Program Gelar Ganda yang Tersedia",
 "Comprehensive training in digital content creation, multimedia production, and creative storytelling combining Korean creative industry expertise with Indonesian market perspectives.": "Pelatihan komprehensif dalam pembuatan konten digital, produksi multimedia, dan penceritaan kreatif yang memadukan keahlian industri kreatif Korea dengan perspektif pasar Indonesia.",
 "Media & Digital": "Media & Digital",
 "Industrial Engineering": "Teknik Industri",
 "Master industrial systems, manufacturing optimization, and production management with exposure to advanced Chinese aerospace and manufacturing sectors.": "Kuasai sistem industri, optimasi manufaktur, dan manajemen produksi dengan paparan sektor kedirgantaraan dan manufaktur Tiongkok yang maju.",
 "Eindhoven, Netherlands": "Eindhoven, Belanda",
 "Advanced software engineering and IT systems combining Dutch innovation culture with practical application development in both Eastern and Western tech ecosystems.": "Rekayasa perangkat lunak dan sistem TI lanjutan yang memadukan budaya inovasi Belanda dengan pengembangan aplikasi praktis di ekosistem teknologi Timur maupun Barat.",
 "International Hotel Management Institute": "International Hotel Management Institute",
 "Hotel Management": "Manajemen Perhotelan",
 "Prestigious hospitality management program combining Swiss hospitality excellence with international business practices and hands-on hotel operations experience.": "Program manajemen perhotelan bergengsi yang memadukan keunggulan perhotelan Swiss dengan praktik bisnis internasional dan pengalaman langsung operasi hotel.",
 "Hospitality": "Perhotelan",
 "3-4 Years": "3-4 Tahun",
 "Ames, Iowa, United States": "Ames, Iowa, Amerika Serikat",
 "Comprehensive civil engineering program combining American engineering standards with sustainable infrastructure development practices for tropical and developing regions.": "Program teknik sipil komprehensif yang memadukan standar teknik Amerika dengan praktik pembangunan infrastruktur berkelanjutan untuk wilayah tropis dan berkembang.",
 "Typical Double Degree Structure": "Struktur Gelar Ganda yang Umum",
 "Year 3-4: Full Program at Partner University": "Tahun 3-4: Program Penuh di Universitas Mitra",
 "Complete remaining degree requirements at international partner. Earn independent degree from partner institution.": "Selesaikan sisa persyaratan gelar di mitra internasional. Raih gelar independen dari institusi mitra.",
 "Two Separate Degrees Awarded": "Dua Gelar Terpisah Diberikan",
 "Receive diplomas from both PCU and partner university. Distinct credentials for global opportunity.": "Terima ijazah dari PCU dan universitas mitra. Kredensial berbeda untuk peluang global.",
 "Earn Two Degrees, Double Your Opportunities": "Raih Dua Gelar, Gandakan Peluang Anda",
 "Complete your double degree and gain credentials from two world-class institutions across different continents.": "Selesaikan gelar ganda Anda dan peroleh kredensial dari dua institusi kelas dunia di benua yang berbeda.",
 "Complete core curriculum and foundational courses at PCU in Surabaya. Build strong academic foundation.": "Selesaikan kurikulum inti dan mata kuliah dasar di PCU Surabaya. Bangun fondasi akademik yang kuat.",
 "Kick-start your career with real-world experience. Explore our industry partners and available internship opportunities.": "Awali karier Anda dengan pengalaman dunia nyata. Jelajahi mitra industri kami dan peluang magang yang tersedia.",
 "Section 1": "Bagian 1",
 "List of Industry Partners": "Daftar Mitra Industri",
 "PCU collaborates with leading companies and organizations across various industries to provide students with meaningful internship experiences.": "PCU bekerja sama dengan perusahaan dan organisasi terkemuka di berbagai industri untuk memberikan mahasiswa pengalaman magang yang bermakna.",
