 "Search partners...": "Cari mitra...",
 "Explore the world through PCU's wide network of partner universities. Study abroad for one semester and earn transferable credits.": "Jelajahi dunia melalui jaringan luas universitas mitra PCU. Belajar di luar negeri selama satu semester dan raih kredit yang dapat ditransfer.",
 "Partner Universities": "Universitas Mitra",
 "Countries Available": "Negara yang Tersedia",
