 "Duration (4–5 months)": "Durasi (4–5 bulan)",
 "Destinations": "Tujuan",
 "Semester Exchange & Study Abroad Possibilities": "Peluang Pertukaran Semester & Belajar di Luar Negeri",
 "Browse our partner universities by region. Click a region to see available destinations.": "Telusuri universitas mitra kami berdasarkan kawasan. Klik kawasan untuk melihat tujuan yang tersedia.",
 "All Regions": "Semua Kawasan",
 "Check Eligibility": "Periksa Kelayakan",
