 "Transcript, language certificate, motivation letter, passport": "Transkrip, sertifikat bahasa, surat motivasi, paspor",
 "Depart & Study": "Berangkat & Belajar",
 "Attend orientation and begin your exchange journey": "Ikuti orientasi dan mulai perjalanan pertukaran Anda",
 "Ready to Go Global?": "Siap Mendunia?",
 "Contact the International Office to start your application.": "Hubungi Kantor Internasional untuk memulai pendaftaran Anda.",
 "Find Petra Christian University in Surabaya with a map, transport tips, and nearby city and mall locations.": "Temukan Universitas Kristen Petra di Surabaya dengan peta, tips transportasi, serta lokasi kota dan mal terdekat.",
 "Petra Christian University (PCU) is located at Jl. Siwalankerto 121-131, Surabaya 60236, Indonesia. The campus sits in a central area of western Surabaya with easy access to major roads and local transport.": "Universitas Kristen Petra (PCU) berlokasi di Jl. Siwalankerto 121-131, Surabaya 60236, Indonesia. Kampus ini berada di area sentral Surabaya bagian barat dengan akses mudah ke jalan utama dan transportasi lokal.",
 "City Center": "Pusat Kota",
 "Approximately 20 minutes from Surabaya city center and the business district.": "Sekitar 20 menit dari pusat kota Surabaya dan kawasan bisnis.",
 "Airport": "Bandara",
 "Around 30 minutes from Juanda International Airport by taxi or ride share.": "Sekitar 30 menit dari Bandara Internasional Juanda dengan taksi atau ride share.",
 "Shopping & Malls": "Belanja & Mal",
 "Close to Tunjungan Plaza, Pakuwon Mall, and BG Junction, all within 30-40 minutes.": "Dekat dengan Tunjungan Plaza, Pakuwon Mall, dan BG Junction, semuanya dalam 30-40 menit.",
 "Transport": "Transportasi",
 "Accessible by Grab, Blue Bird taxi, and local bus services across Surabaya.": "Dapat diakses dengan Grab, taksi Blue Bird, dan layanan bus lokal di seluruh Surabaya.",
 "Nearby Landmarks": "Landmark Terdekat",
 "PCU is within easy reach of Surabaya's Western Corridor.": "PCU mudah dijangkau dari Koridor Barat Surabaya.",
 "Tunjungan Plaza and Pakuwon Mall are the closest major shopping centers.": "Tunjungan Plaza dan Pakuwon Mall adalah pusat perbelanjaan besar terdekat.",
 "Surabaya's major train stations are 20-30 minutes away by car.": "Stasiun kereta utama Surabaya berjarak 20-30 menit dengan mobil.",
 "Peak travel time around the campus is typically 25-35 minutes during rush hour.": "Waktu tempuh puncak di sekitar kampus biasanya 25-35 menit pada jam sibuk.",
 "Travel Tips": "Tips Perjalanan",
 "For first-time visitors, use ride-hailing apps or a trusted taxi from Juanda Airport. Ask your driver to use the campus address and verify with the university's official address.": "Bagi pengunjung pertama kali, gunakan aplikasi ride-hailing atau taksi tepercaya dari Bandara Juanda. Minta pengemudi menggunakan alamat kampus dan verifikasi dengan alamat resmi universitas.",
 "If you plan to explore the city, Surabaya offers easy access to restaurants, malls, and cultural areas from the area around PCU.": "Jika Anda berencana menjelajahi kota, Surabaya menawarkan akses mudah ke restoran, mal, dan kawasan budaya dari area sekitar PCU.",
 "Essential information about visa requirements and immigration procedures for international students studying at Petra Christian University in Indonesia.": "Informasi penting tentang persyaratan visa dan prosedur imigrasi bagi mahasiswa internasional yang belajar di Universitas Kristen Petra di Indonesia.",
 "Student Visa Types": "Jenis Visa Pelajar",
 "Student Visa (KITAS)": "Visa Pelajar (KITAS)",
 "Limited Stay Permit for students enrolled in Indonesian educational institutions. Valid for up to 1 year, renewable.": "Izin Tinggal Terbatas bagi mahasiswa yang terdaftar di institusi pendidikan Indonesia. Berlaku hingga 1 tahun, dapat diperpanjang.",
 "Social-Cultural Visa": "Visa Sosial-Budaya",
 "For participants in exchange programs, research, or cultural activities. Maximum stay of 90 days.": "Untuk peserta program pertukaran, penelitian, atau kegiatan budaya. Masa tinggal maksimal 90 hari.",
 "Business Visa": "Visa Bisnis",
 "For internship programs or research activities with business purposes.": "Untuk program magang atau kegiatan penelitian dengan tujuan bisnis.",
 "Required Documents": "Dokumen yang Diperlukan",
 "Valid passport (minimum 6 months validity)": "Paspor yang berlaku (masa berlaku minimal 6 bulan)",
