 "Financial proof (bank statements, sponsorship letter)": "Bukti keuangan (rekening koran, surat sponsor)",
 "Police clearance certificate": "Surat keterangan catatan kepolisian",
 "Medical certificate": "Surat keterangan sehat",
 "Apply to PCU": "Mendaftar ke PCU",
 "Receive official acceptance letter from Petra Christian University.": "Terima surat penerimaan resmi dari Universitas Kristen Petra.",
 "Prepare Documents": "Siapkan Dokumen",
 "Gather all required documents and have them legalized if necessary.": "Kumpulkan semua dokumen yang diperlukan dan legalisasi jika diperlukan.",
 "Apply for Visa": "Mengajukan Visa",
 "Submit visa application at Indonesian embassy or consulate in your country.": "Ajukan permohonan visa di kedutaan atau konsulat Indonesia di negara Anda.",
 "Immigration on Arrival": "Imigrasi saat Kedatangan",
 "Complete immigration procedures at the airport and register with local immigration office.": "Selesaikan prosedur imigrasi di bandara dan daftarkan diri ke kantor imigrasi setempat.",
 "Important Information": "Informasi Penting",
 "Processing Time:": "Waktu Pemrosesan:",
 "Visa applications typically take 3-7 business days at Indonesian embassies.": "Permohonan visa biasanya memakan waktu 3-7 hari kerja di kedutaan Indonesia.",
 "Visa Fee:": "Biaya Visa:",
 "Varies by nationality and visa type. Contact your nearest Indonesian embassy for current fees.": "Bervariasi menurut kewarganegaraan dan jenis visa. Hubungi kedutaan Indonesia terdekat untuk biaya terkini.",
 "Health Insurance:": "Asuransi Kesehatan:",
 "Mandatory for all international students. Must cover at least $10,000 for medical expenses.": "Wajib bagi semua mahasiswa internasional. Harus mencakup minimal $10.000 untuk biaya medis.",
 "Reporting:": "Pelaporan:",
 "Must report to local immigration office within 10 days of arrival for KITAS extension.": "Wajib melapor ke kantor imigrasi setempat dalam 10 hari setelah kedatangan untuk perpanjangan KITAS.",
 "Need Help with Your Visa?": "Butuh Bantuan dengan Visa Anda?",
 "The International Office at Petra Christian University provides guidance and support for visa applications and immigration procedures. Contact us for assistance.": "Kantor Internasional Universitas Kristen Petra menyediakan panduan dan dukungan untuk permohonan visa dan prosedur imigrasi. Hubungi kami untuk bantuan.",
 "Everything you need before departure and during arrival in Surabaya.": "Semua yang Anda perlukan sebelum keberangkatan dan saat tiba di Surabaya.",
 "Download Guidebook": "Unduh Buku Panduan",
 "Pre-Departure Checklist": "Daftar Periksa Pra-Keberangkatan",
 "Confirm your student visa and travel documents.": "Konfirmasikan visa pelajar dan dokumen perjalanan Anda.",
 "Arrange airport transfer and arrival logistics.": "Atur penjemputan bandara dan logistik kedatangan.",
 "Pack essentials, local SIM card, and currency for initial expenses.": "Siapkan kebutuhan pokok, kartu SIM lokal, dan mata uang untuk pengeluaran awal.",
 "Arrival Guide": "Panduan Kedatangan",
 "Arrive at Juanda International Airport and use a trusted ride service to PCU.": "Tiba di Bandara Internasional Juanda dan gunakan layanan transportasi tepercaya menuju PCU.",
 "Check in with the International Office upon arrival for orientation support.": "Lapor ke Kantor Internasional saat tiba untuk dukungan orientasi.",
 "Confirm your accommodation arrangements before leaving the airport.": "Konfirmasikan pengaturan akomodasi Anda sebelum meninggalkan bandara.",
 "Health Insurance": "Asuransi Kesehatan",
 "We recommend students have either Health & Travel Insurance from their home country before arriving in Indonesia. This is the preferred coverage for international students during the exchange period.": "Kami menyarankan mahasiswa memiliki Asuransi Kesehatan & Perjalanan dari negara asal sebelum tiba di Indonesia. Ini adalah jaminan yang disarankan bagi mahasiswa internasional selama periode pertukaran.",
 "Make sure your plan includes medical evacuation, emergency care, and COVID-19 coverage if available.": "Pastikan polis Anda mencakup evakuasi medis, perawatan darurat, dan perlindungan COVID-19 jika tersedia.",
 "First Week Checklist": "Daftar Periksa Minggu Pertama",
 "Register at the International Office and attend orientation events.": "Daftar di Kantor Internasional dan ikuti acara orientasi.",
 "Confirm your class schedule and campus facilities tour.": "Konfirmasikan jadwal kelas dan tur fasilitas kampus Anda.",
 "Open a local bank account if needed and get a local SIM card.": "Buka rekening bank lokal jika diperlukan dan dapatkan kartu SIM lokal.",
 "Accommodation": "Akomodasi",
 "Information about student accommodation at Petra Christian University will be available soon. For now, this page gives an overview of the types of housing options international students can expect.": "Informasi tentang akomodasi mahasiswa di Universitas Kristen Petra akan segera tersedia. Untuk saat ini, halaman ini memberikan gambaran umum jenis pilihan hunian yang dapat diharapkan mahasiswa internasional.",
 "Student Dorms": "Asrama Mahasiswa",
 "On-campus or near-campus dormitories may be available for international students depending on availability.": "Asrama di dalam atau dekat kampus mungkin tersedia bagi mahasiswa internasional tergantung ketersediaan.",
 "Apartments": "Apartemen",
 "Many students choose shared apartments close to campus and shopping centers for convenience.": "Banyak mahasiswa memilih apartemen bersama yang dekat dengan kampus dan pusat perbelanjaan demi kenyamanan.",
 "Homestay": "Homestay",
 "Homestay options allow students to live with local families and experience Indonesian culture firsthand.": "Pilihan homestay memungkinkan mahasiswa tinggal bersama keluarga lokal dan merasakan budaya Indonesia secara langsung.",
 "Explore our global network of partnerships spanning 6 continents and 55 countries, connecting PCU with leading institutions worldwide.": "Jelajahi jaringan kemitraan global kami yang mencakup 6 benua dan 55 negara, menghubungkan PCU dengan institusi terkemuka di seluruh dunia.",
 "Global Partnerships": "Kemitraan Global",
 "Partnership Impact": "Dampak Kemitraan",
